<title>ST VINCENT AND THE GRENADINES: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 157-3 V WEST INDIES(147), 2ND TEST - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 157-3 V WEST INDIES(147), 2ND TEST - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTOWN, St Vincent 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka were 157 for three in reply to West Indies' first innings total of 147 at the close of play on the opening day of the second and final test on Friday.</p>
</text>
